# =============================================================================
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej
.scratch/
scratchpad/

# =============================================================================
# Lockfiles are deliberately absent from this file
# Resolved versions are locked reproducibly, so package-lock.json,
# pnpm-lock.yaml, yarn.lock, go.sum and Cargo.lock are committed, not ignored.
# =============================================================================
